### 6. **CertGenUtilsTests.java:181, 184** — Duplicate assertion in test
**Type: Test defect (harmless but sloppy)**

```java
assertThat(keyUsage.hasUsages(KEY_USAGE_MAPPINGS.get("digitalSignature")), is(true));
assertThat(keyUsage.hasUsages(KEY_USAGE_MAPPINGS.get("nonRepudiation")), is(true));
assertThat(keyUsage.hasUsages(KEY_USAGE_MAPPINGS.get("digitalSignature")), is(true));  // DUPLICATE
assertThat(keyUsage.hasUsages(KEY_USAGE_MAPPINGS.get("keyEncipherment")), is(true));
```

Line 184 repeats line 181. Remove the duplicate.

